# Claude Code Configuration (User Level)

# This file lives at ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md and applies to ALL projects.
# It is the entry point for Infinite Memory Mode.

## SESSION START PROTOCOL (MANDATORY)
**IMMEDIATELY on every new session**, before responding to the user:
1. Read `~/.claude/user/profile.md` - this contains who the user is
2. Read `~/.claude/user/preferences.md` - this contains how they like to work
3. Read `~/.claude/workspace.md` - this contains their projects and relationships
4. Execute the Session Start Protocol in MEMORY.md - read `~/.claude/memory-config.json`, then the vault's knowledge-map, global-index, project hot cache, and People/_Preferences.md
5. Apply this context to all interactions - you have history with this person
6. Greet them with awareness of your ongoing relationship, not as a stranger

This user values continuity. You are not starting fresh - you are continuing a relationship.

---

